  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pp7n](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pp7n) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 141.02 depth occurred on Apr 01 2025 80km NW of Lelang. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.5857 longitude 128.6061. It impacted 1461 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
